flowchart LR
 UI[Tauri UI: project/product/generator/settings] --> IPC[Typed IPC + scope checks]
 IPC --> Core[Rust domain/workflow core]
 Core --> Policy[Rights + effect registry + approvals + budget]
 Core --> DB[(SQLite metadata + journal)]
 Core --> Files[Filesystem source/versioned artifacts]
 Policy --> Ports[Normalized adapter ports]
 Ports --> API[Official provider API]
 Ports --> MCP[MCP client: reviewed stdio/HTTP server]
 Ports --> Host[Rust native host + per-user paired pipe]
 Host --> Ext[Opt-in Chrome extension + selected tab]
 Ports --> FF[Local FFmpeg + ffprobe]
 Ports -. M2 .-> BL[Blender or Three.js renderer]
 FF --> QA[Technical checks + human audiovisual/product QA]
 QA --> Export[Manual-posting export package]
